  privacyPolicyContent: "\n\nEffective Date: 30/10/2026\nThiprada and Pareena built
    the Platu Salmon game as a Free game. This SERVICE is provided by Thiprada and
    Pareena at no cost and is intended for use as is.\r\n\r\nThis page is used to
    inform visitors regarding my policies with the collection, use, and disclosure
    of Personal Information if anyone decided to use my Service.\r\n\r\nIf you choose
    to use my Service, then you agree to the collection and use of information in
    relation to this policy. The Personal Information that I collect is used for
    providing and improving the Service. I will not use or share your information
    with anyone except as described in this Privacy Policy.\r\n\r\nThe terms used
    in this Privacy Policy have the same meanings as in our Terms and Conditions,
    which is accessible at Platu Salmon unless otherwise defined in this Privacy
    Policy.\r\n\r\nInformation Collection and Use\r\n\r\nFor a better experience,
    while using our Service, I may require you to provide us with certain personally
    identifiable information, including but not limited to Email. The information
    that I request will be retained on your device and is not collected by me in
    any way.\r\n\r\nThe game does use third party services that may collect information
    used to identify you.\r\n\r\nLink to privacy policy of third party service providers
    used by the game\r\n\r\nUnity\r\nLog Data\r\n\r\nI want to inform you that whenever
    you use my Service, in a case of an error in the game I collect data and information
    (through third party products) on your phone called Log Data. This Log Data may
    include information such as your device Internet Protocol (\u201CIP\u201D) address,
    device name, operating system version, the configuration of the game when utilizing
    my Service, the time and date of your use of the Service, and other statistics.\r\n\r\nCookies\r\n\r\nCookies
    are files with a small amount of data that are commonly used as anonymous unique
    identifiers. These are sent to your browser from the websites that you visit
    and are stored on your device's internal memory.\r\n\r\nThis Service does not
    use these \u201Ccookies\u201D explicitly. However, the game may use third party
    code and libraries that use \u201Ccookies\u201D to collect information and improve
    their services. You have the option to either accept or refuse these cookies
    and know when a cookie is being sent to your device. If you choose to refuse
    our cookies, you may not be able to use some portions of this Service.\r\n\r\nService
    Providers\r\n\r\nI may employ third-party companies and individuals due to the
    following reasons:\r\n\r\nTo facilitate our Service;\r\nTo provide the Service
    on our behalf;\r\nTo perform Service-related services; or\r\nTo assist us in
    analyzing how our Service is used.\r\nI want to inform users of this Service
    that these third parties have access to your Personal Information. The reason
    is to perform the tasks assigned to them on our behalf. However, they are obligated
    not to disclose or use the information for any other purpose.\r\n\r\nSecurity\r\n\r\nI
    value your trust in providing us your Personal Information, thus we are striving
    to use commercially acceptable means of protecting it. But remember that no method
    of transmission over the internet, or method of electronic storage is 100% secure
    and reliable, and I cannot guarantee its absolute security.\r\n\r\nLinks to Other
    Sites\r\n\r\nThis Service may contain links to other sites. If you click on a
    third-party link, you will be directed to that site. Note that these external
    sites are not operated by me. Therefore, I strongly advise you to review the
    Privacy Policy of these websites. I have no control over and assume no responsibility
    for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party sites or services.\r\n\r\nChildren\u2019s
    Privacy\r\n\r\nThese Services do not address anyone under the age of 13. I do
    not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from children under
    13. In the case I discover that a child under 13 has provided me with personal
    information, I immediately delete this from our servers. If you are a parent
    or guardian and you are aware that your child has provided us with personal information,
    please contact me so that I will be able to do necessary actions.\r\n\r\nChanges
    to This Privacy Policy\r\n\r\nI may update our Privacy Policy from time to time.
    Thus, you are advised to review this page periodically for any changes. I will
    notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page. These
    changes are effective immediately after they are posted on this page.\r\n\r\nContact
    Us\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or suggestions about my Privacy Policy, do
    not hesitate to contact me at Thiprada.mopad@gmail.com."
  userAgreementContent: '


    Effective Date: 30/10/2026

    This End User License
    Agreement ("Agreement") is a legal agreement between you ("User") and the developers
    of Platu Salmon, Thiprada and Pareena ("Developers"), regarding your use of the
    Platu Salmon mobile game ("Application").


    By downloading, installing, or
    using Platu Salmon, you agree to be bound by the terms of this Agreement. If
    you do not agree with these terms, please do not download, install, or use the
    Application.


    1. License to Use


    The Developers grant you a limited,
    non-exclusive, non-transferable, and non-sublicensable license to download, install,
    and use Platu Salmon for personal, non-commercial purposes, subject to this Agreement
    and Apple''s applicable terms and conditions.


    2. Intellectual Property


    All
    intellectual property rights in Platu Salmon, including its characters, artwork,
    graphics, animations, music, game design, and source code, belong to their respective
    owners, including Thiprada and Pareena, unless otherwise stated.


    Users
    may not copy, reproduce, distribute, modify, reverse engineer, or create derivative
    works from any part of the Application without prior written permission from
    the Developers, except where permitted by applicable law.


    3. User Accounts


    Users
    may be required to create an account to access certain features of the Application.


    Users
    are responsible for providing accurate information, maintaining the confidentiality
    of their login credentials, and notifying the Developers if they become aware
    of unauthorized access to their accounts.


    Users must not misuse, share,
    or attempt to gain unauthorized access to another user''s account.


    4. User
    Data and Game Progress


    The Application may collect and store account information
    and gameplay data, such as email addresses, usernames, character selections,
    and game progress, to provide account management and gameplay functionality.


    Users
    acknowledge that game progress and account information may be stored on third-party
    services used by the Developers.


    The Developers will make reasonable efforts
    to protect user data but cannot guarantee uninterrupted access or prevent every
    possible technical issue or data loss.


    5. User Conduct


    Users agree
    not to:


    Use the Application for unlawful purposes.


    Attempt to hack,
    exploit, or disrupt the Application or its services.


    Access or modify another
    user''s account or data without permission.


    Reverse engineer or interfere
    with the Application''s functionality.


    Use unauthorized tools or methods
    to manipulate gameplay or game data.


    6. Updates and Maintenance


    The
    Developers may release updates, improvements, bug fixes, or new features from
    time to time.


    The Developers will make reasonable efforts to maintain the
    Application and improve its functionality. However, continuous availability and
    compatibility with all devices and operating system versions cannot be guaranteed.


    7.
    Third-Party Services


    The Application may use third-party services for authentication,
    data storage, and other functionalities.


    Your use of these services may
    be subject to the respective third-party terms and privacy policies.


    The
    Developers are not responsible for services or actions controlled by third parties,
    except as required by applicable law.


    8. Limitation of Liability


    The
    Developers will make reasonable efforts to ensure that the Application functions
    properly.


    However, the Developers do not guarantee that the Application
    will always be available, uninterrupted, or free from errors.


    To the extent
    permitted by applicable law, the Developers will not be liable for indirect or
    consequential damages arising from the use of the Application.


    Nothing
    in this Agreement excludes or limits liability that cannot legally be excluded
    or limited.


    9. Termination


    The Developers may suspend or terminate
    access to the Application if a user seriously violates this Agreement or misuses
    the Application.


    Users may stop using the Application at any time by uninstalling
    it and may contact the Developers regarding account deletion or personal data
    requests.


    10. Changes to This Agreement


    The Developers reserve the
    right to update this Agreement when necessary.


    Any changes will be published
    through the Application or another appropriate communication channel. Continued
    use of the Application after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the
    updated terms, where permitted by applicable law.


    11. Governing Law


    This
    Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Thailand, without prejudice to any
    mandatory consumer protection rights applicable to users in their country of
    residence.


    12. Contact Information


    For questions, concerns, or requests
    regarding this Agreement, please contact:


    Developers: Thiprada and Pareena


    Application:
    Platu Salmon


    Email: Thiprada.mopad@gmail.com'
  termsConditionsContent: '


    Effective Date: 30/10/2026

    By downloading
    or using the game, these Terms of Use will automatically apply to you. You should
    therefore make sure that you read them carefully before using the game.


    You
    are not allowed to copy or modify the game, any part of the game, or our trademarks
    in any way without our prior written permission. You are not allowed to attempt
    to extract the source code of the game, reverse engineer it, translate the game
    into other languages, or create derivative versions of it, except where permitted
    by applicable law. The game itself, and all trademarks, copyrights, database
    rights, and other intellectual property rights related to it, belong to Thiprada
    and Pareena or their respective rights holders.


    The Platu Salmon game stores
    and processes personal data that you provide to us in order to provide our services.
    This may include information such as your email address, username, account information,
    and game progress. It is your responsibility to keep your device and access to
    the game secure. We therefore recommend that you do not jailbreak or root your
    device, which is the process of removing software restrictions and limitations
    imposed by the official operating system of your device. This could make your
    device more vulnerable to malware, viruses, and other malicious programs, compromise
    your device''s security features, and cause the Platu Salmon game to malfunction
    or stop working altogether.


    You should be aware that there are certain
    things for which Thiprada and Pareena cannot take responsibility. Certain functions
    of the game require an active internet connection. The connection can be provided
    through Wi-Fi or your mobile network provider. However, we cannot guarantee that
    the game will function properly if you do not have access to Wi-Fi or have used
    up your available mobile data allowance.


    If you are using the game outside
    an area with Wi-Fi, you should remember that the terms of your agreement with
    your mobile network provider will still apply. As a result, you may be charged
    by your mobile provider for data usage while accessing the game or for other
    third-party charges. By using the game, you accept responsibility for any such
    charges, including roaming data charges if you use the game outside your home
    country or region without turning off data roaming. If you are not the bill payer
    for the device on which you are using the game, please be aware that we assume
    you have received permission from the bill payer to use the game.


    Along
    the same lines, Thiprada and Pareena cannot always take responsibility for issues
    relating to the way you use your device. You need to make sure that your device
    stays charged and functions properly. If your device runs out of battery and
    you are unable to access the game, we cannot accept responsibility for interruptions
    caused by this issue.


    With respect to Thiprada and Pareena''s responsibility
    for your use of the game, we make reasonable efforts to ensure that the game
    is updated and functions correctly. However, the game may rely on third parties
    to provide certain services and functionality, including account authentication
    and data storage. We cannot guarantee that these third-party services will always
    be available or function without interruption. Thiprada and Pareena cannot be
    held responsible for losses or interruptions caused by third-party services beyond
    our reasonable control, subject to applicable law.


    At some point, we may
    wish to update the game. The game is currently available on iOS. The system requirements
    and compatibility may change over time, and you may need to download updates
    if you want to continue using the game or certain features. Thiprada and Pareena
    will make reasonable efforts to maintain and update the game but cannot guarantee
    that it will always be compatible with every iOS version or device. We may also
    modify, suspend, or discontinue the game or certain features when reasonably
    necessary. Where appropriate, we will provide notice to users. If the game is
    discontinued, the rights and licenses granted to you under these terms may end,
    and you may be required to stop using the game and, if necessary, delete it from
    your device.


    Changes to These Terms of Use


    We may update our Terms
    of Use from time to time. Therefore, you are advised to review this page periodically
    for any changes. We will notify users of significant changes by posting the updated
    Terms of Use on this page. These changes will take effect from the date stated
    in the updated terms, subject to applicable law.


    Contact Us


    If you
    have any questions or suggestions about our Terms of Use, please do not hesitate
    to contact us at:


    Email: Thiprada.mopad@gmail.com


    Developers: Thiprada
    and Pareena'
